        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;color:var(--mid);font-size:0.9rem;">→</div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:16px 8px;background:var(--cream);border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--ink);">150K</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--mid);margin-top:4px;">Impressions</div>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align:center;color:var(--mid);font-size:0.9rem;">→</div>
        <div style="text-align:center;padding:16px 8px;background:var(--cream);border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;border:1px solid var(--border);">
          <div style="font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:1.4rem;color:var(--teal-t);">184</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.6rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--mid);margin-top:4px;">Leads</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;background:#fff9f9;border:1px solid #f5c6c6;border-left:3px solid var(--coral);border-radius:0 6px 6px 0;font-size:0.78rem;color:#7a3030;line-height:1.5;">
        ⚑ <strong>Not delivering.</strong> CPL was AED 47.80 — above best-in-period (AED 33.38). Audience likely exhausted. Recommend creative refresh + audience expansion before reactivating.
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Full table -->
    <span class="ads-section-label">Full campaign breakdown</span>
    <div class="ads-card">
      <table class="ads-tbl">
        <thead><tr>
          <td>Campaign</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">Spend</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">Leads</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">CPL (AED)</td>
          <td style="text-align:right;">Type</td>
        </tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>DF | Prospecting | Lead Forms <span class="ads-bdg ads-bpa">Not delivering</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 8,795</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">184</td><td style="text-align:right;color:#B45309;font-weight:500;">47.80</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Lead form</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F2/3 Retargeting – UAE – March <span class="ads-bdg ads-bac">Active</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 1,235</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">37</td><td style="text-align:right;" class="ads-cg">33.38</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Lead form</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F1 – UAE – Leads – March <span class="ads-bdg ads-bac">Active</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 728</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">9</td><td style="text-align:right;" class="ads-cb">80.93</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Lead form</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F1 Lookalikes – UAE – March <span class="ads-bdg ads-bac">Active</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 441</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">7</td><td style="text-align:right;color:#B45309;font-weight:500;">63.06</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Lead form</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F1 Interests – Abu Dhabi – Feb <span class="ads-bdg ads-bpa">Inactive</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 503</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">4</td><td style="text-align:right;" class="ads-cb">125.65</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Pixel</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F2/3 – Abu Dhabi – Feb <span class="ads-bdg ads-bpa">Inactive</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 360</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">4</td><td style="text-align:right;" class="ads-cb">89.96</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Pixel</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F2/3 – Dubai – Feb <span class="ads-bdg ads-bpa">Inactive</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 290</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">2</td><td style="text-align:right;" class="ads-cb">145.17</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Pixel</td></tr>
          <tr><td>F1 Interests – Dubai – Feb <span class="ads-bdg ads-bpa">Inactive</span></td><td style="text-align:right;">AED 665</td><td style="text-align:right;opacity:.7;">1</td><td style="text-align:right;" class="ads-cb">664.51</td><td style="text-align:right;font-size:11px;opacity:.6;">Pixel</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <span class="ads-section-label">Key findings for Morph</span>
    <div class="ads-ins ads-ins-g">F2/3 Retargeting UAE is the benchmark — AED 33.38 CPL, 37 leads. Retargeting warm audiences outperforms cold prospecting at every level.</div>
    <div class="ads-ins ads-ins-l">Lead forms (AED 47.26 CPL, 237 leads) are 3.5× cheaper than pixel (AED 165 CPL, 11 leads). All pixel campaigns now inactive.</div>
    <div class="ads-ins ads-ins-d">Lead form campaigns: 2,743 clicks → only 57 LPVs (98% drop). Site-wide post-click issue — mobile load or GA4 tag not firing. Morph to audit before scaling.</div>
    <div class="ads-ins ads-ins-w">Pixel campaigns actually had solid click-to-LPV rates (60–66%). The issue was pixel attribution setup, not the landing page — worth fixing before ruling out this campaign type.</div>
    <div class="ads-ins ads-ins-w">DF | Lead Forms (74% of leads) has stopped delivering. Audience of 58,732 exhausted — needs creative refresh before reactivation.</div>
    <div class="ads-ins ads-ins-d">F2/3 Abu Dhabi Feb: highest frequency at 3.17 — audience overserved, likely contributing to low lead volume despite decent reach.</div>

  </div><!-- end metaview-leads -->

  <!-- ===== IG AWARENESS TAB ===== -->
  <div class="metaview" id="metaview-ig">

    <div class="ads-metric-grid" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="ads-mc"><p class="ads-ml">Spend</p><p class="ads-mv">AED 844</p><p class="ads-ms">Safety & Care campaign</p></div>
      <div class="ads-mc"><p class="ads-ml">Profile visits</p><p class="ads-mv">1,953</p><p class="ads-ms">AED 0.43 each</p></div>
      <div class="ads-mc"><p class="ads-ml">Reach</p><p class="ads-mv">61,147</p><p class="ads-ms">unique users</p></div>
