      <div style="font-size:0.72rem;color:var(--mid);margin-bottom:16px;">2,180 clicks → only 22 landing page views. 99% drop — flagged for Morph review.</div>
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;">
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:4px;"><span style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;">Reach</span><span style="color:var(--mid);">61,147</span></div>
