        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:0.75rem;margin-bottom:4px;"><span style="color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;">Landing page views</span><span style="color:#993C1D;font-weight:500;">22 (1% of clicks) ⚠</span></div>
